{
  "version": 2,
  "rewrites": [
    ...
  ]
}
```[span_1](start_span)[span_1](end_span)

Aapke `vercel.json` mein `/version.json` ka koi route ya rewrite define hi nahi hai[span_2](start_span)[span_2](end_span)! 
Vercel par jab koi static file nahi milti aur express server par rewrite nahi hota, toh Vercel `Cannot GET /version.json` fek deta hai[span_3](start_span)[span_3](end_span)[span_4](start_span)[span_4](end_span).

Isko turant theek karne ke liye GitHub par **`vercel.json`** file ko open karke poora is code se replace kar dijiye[span_5](start_span)[span_5](end_span):

```json
{
  "version": 2,
  "rewrites": [
    {
      "source": "/.well-known/assetlinks.json",
      "destination": "/public/.well-known/assetlinks.json"
    },
    {
      "source": "/version.json",
      "destination": "/bot.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "/check-update",
      "destination": "/bot.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "/api/check-update",
      "destination": "/bot.js"
    },
    {
      "source": "/app-release.apk",
      "destination": "https://github.com/MayaJaal1/mayajaall/releases/latest/download/app-release.apk"
    },
    {
      "source": "/download",
      "destination": "/download.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/download.html",
      "destination": "/download.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/v/:id*",
      "destination": "/player.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/tb/:id*",
      "destination": "/player.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/key",
      "destination": "/index.html"
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "destination": "/bot.js"
    }
  ]
}
